v 3
d projectbuilder: scaffold a data-analysis project folder with a numbered do-file pipeline
d
d projectbuilder creates a new project folder with the five-folder
d layout (raw, clean, code, output, figures), a control file that
d holds every path in one place and can rebuild the whole pipeline,
d numbered do-file stubs (100_ingest through 500_report), and a
d README stamped with the project metadata you pass as options.
d Metadata does double duty: the source URL seeds the ingest stub,
d outcome and by-variable lists seed the analysis stub, and a
d descsave flag seeds a codebook call in the cleaning stub. The
d program never overwrites an existing folder, is self-contained
d (no template folder), and uses only Stata's cross-platform file
d commands.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer. No dependencies.
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
d
